          "name": "PAIR.md",
          "language": "md",
          "contents": "## Prompt \nAsk AI how to update object properties using dot notation \nand bracket notation\n\n## Analyze \nExamine the AI’s examples, noting the similarities and differences \nbetween the two methods.\n\n## Integrate \nTry both methods to change property values\n\n## Reflect \nWhich syntax feels easier or clearer? \n\n\nWhen might you need bracket notation instead?\n\n",
